        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Day After, I Like to Rock\n- Places: Ontario, De Soto High School, Ontario Highway 17\n- Topics: film air dates, TV ratings, recording locations\n\nFacts:\n- The Day After is a 1982 film that aired in 1983.\n- The Day After was the seventh highest rated non-sports television show.\n- The Canadian state referenced is Ontario because Ontario Highway 17 is a provincial highway in Ontario.\n- De Soto High School in Ontario is located off Ontario Highway 17.\n- The album I Like to Rock was recorded in Ontario.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
