        "original_id": "05f15bf3-c62b-5916-8c1f-6b2ad8d075b0",
        "text": "The Day After, a 1982 film that aired in 1983, was the seventh highest rated non-sports show and featured an Canadian state highway. The De Soto High Schoo in the Canadian state is located off this highway. The album \"I Like to Rock\" was recorded in the Canadian state.",
